      "summaries": {
        "en": "Awesome Remote Job is a curated GitHub repository that solves the challenge of finding reliable remote work opportunities by aggregating vetted job boards, companies, and resources in one place. Its technical strength lies in the 'awesome-list' format—a community-maintained, structured collection that evolves through contributions, ensuring quality through curation rather than algorithms. You can use it to discover remote-friendly companies, access productivity tools, or contribute by adding verified resources, making it both a practical job-hunting aid and a collaborative knowledge base.",
        "zh": "Awesome Remote Job 是一个精心整理的 GitHub 资源库，旨在解决远程工作者寻找可靠机会的难题，它汇总了经过筛选的招聘平台、公司和实用工具。其核心采用“awesome-list”格式，这是一个由社区维护的结构化清单，通过用户贡献不断更新，依靠人工审核而非算法来保证质量。你可以用它探索支持远程办公的企业、获取效率工具，或通过添加已验证资源参与共建，使其既是求职者的实用指南，也是一个协作共享的知识库。",
        "es": "Awesome Remote Job is a curated GitHub repository that solves the challenge of finding reliable remote work opportunities by aggregating vetted job boards, companies, and resources in one place. Its technical strength lies in the 'awesome-list' format—a community-maintained, structured collection that evolves through contributions, ensuring quality through curation rather than algorithms. You can use it to discover remote-friendly companies, access productivity tools, or contribute by adding verified resources, making it both a practical job-hunting aid and a collaborative knowledge base.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "awesome-remote-job stands out for awesome, awesome-list, and list in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Awesome Remote Job is a curated GitHub repository that solves the challenge of finding reliable remote work opportunities by aggregating vetted job boards, companies, and resources in one place. Its technical strength lies in the 'awesome-list' format—a community-maintained, structured collection that evolves through contributions, ensuring quality through curation rather than algorithms. You can use it to discover remote-friendly companies, access productivity tools, or contribute by adding verified resources, making it both a practical job-hunting aid and a collaborative knowledge base.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/lukasz-madon/awesome-remote-job for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
