      "summaries": {
        "en": "go2rtc is a versatile media server that solves the challenge of streaming security camera feeds across different protocols and devices. Its technical strength lies in using Go's concurrency model to efficiently transcode and relay streams between formats like RTSP, WebRTC, and HLS in real-time. You can deploy it as a Docker container to bridge legacy RTSP cameras with modern web interfaces or HomeKit, enabling seamless monitoring from any browser or mobile app.",
        "zh": "go2rtc 是一款多功能媒体服务器，旨在解决安防摄像头流在不同协议和设备间兼容的难题。它采用 Go 语言的并发模型，能高效实时转码和转发 RTSP、WebRTC、HLS 等格式流，核心在于轻量级架构避免了传统方案的重编码开销。通过 Docker 部署，可将旧式 RTSP 摄像头无缝接入现代网页或 HomeKit，实现跨平台实时监控，适合智能家居或轻量级监控场景的快速集成实验。",
        "es": "go2rtc is a versatile media server that solves the challenge of streaming security camera feeds across different protocols and devices. Its technical strength lies in using Go's concurrency model to efficiently transcode and relay streams between formats like RTSP, WebRTC, and HLS in real-time. You can deploy it as a Docker container to bridge legacy RTSP cameras with modern web interfaces or HomeKit, enabling seamless monitoring from any browser or mobile app.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "go2rtc stands out for ffmpeg, h264, and h265 in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "go2rtc is a versatile media server that solves the challenge of streaming security camera feeds across different protocols and devices. Its technical strength lies in using Go's concurrency model to efficiently transcode and relay streams between formats like RTSP, WebRTC, and HLS in real-time. You can deploy it as a Docker container to bridge legacy RTSP cameras with modern web interfaces or HomeKit, enabling seamless monitoring from any browser or mobile app.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/AlexxIT/go2rtc for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
