      "summaries": {
        "en": "Agent Lightning is a training framework that helps developers create more capable and reliable AI agents by addressing the challenge of inconsistent performance in complex tasks. It employs reinforcement learning techniques to systematically improve agent decision-making through iterative feedback loops, teaching agents to learn from their mistakes. Developers can use it to train custom agents for applications like automated customer support or game-playing bots, with the framework providing tools to monitor progress and refine behaviors.",
        "zh": "Agent Lightning 是一个专为提升AI智能体性能而设计的训练框架，旨在解决智能体在复杂任务中表现不稳定的问题。它通过强化学习技术，让智能体在模拟环境中反复试错并优化决策策略，从而学会更可靠地执行任务。开发者可以利用该框架训练定制化智能体，例如用于自动化客服或游戏对战场景，框架提供的监控工具还能帮助实时调整训练过程，让智能体在实践中不断进化。",
        "es": "Agent Lightning is a training framework that helps developers create more capable and reliable AI agents by addressing the challenge of inconsistent performance in complex tasks. It employs reinforcement learning techniques to systematically improve agent decision-making through iterative feedback loops, teaching agents to learn from their mistakes. Developers can use it to train custom agents for applications like automated customer support or game-playing bots, with the framework providing tools to monitor progress and refine behaviors.",
