          "what": "Agent Lightning is a training framework that helps developers create more capable and reliable AI agents by addressing the challenge of inconsistent performance in complex tasks. It employs reinforcement learning techniques to systematically improve agent decision-making through iterative feedback loops, teaching agents to learn from their mistakes. Developers can use it to train custom agents for applications like automated customer support or game-playing bots, with the framework providing tools to monitor progress and refine behaviors.",
